<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tether USDT (USDT) - Official Project & Loyalty Portal</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #0b0e14; color: #e2e8f0; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 20px; }
        .card { background: #151a23; border: 1px solid #2d3748; border-radius: 16px; max-width: 550px; width: 100%; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); text-align: center; }
        .logo-placeholder { width: 90px; height: 90px; margin: 0 auto 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3182ce, #2b6cb0); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: white; border: 3px solid #4a5568; }
        h1 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #ffffff; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; background: rgba(66, 153, 225, 0.2); color: #63b3ed; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        p { color: #a0aec0; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 15px; }
        .info-box { background: #1e2633; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; text-align: right; margin-bottom: 24px; border: 1px solid #2d3748; }
        .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #2d3748; font-size: 14px; }
        .info-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .label { color: #718096; }
        .value { color: #e2e8f0; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #4a5568; margin-top: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="logo-placeholder">USDT</div>
        <h1>KDMTANKERS (KDMT)</h1>
        <span class="badge">نظام ولاء ومكافآت العملاء</span>
        
        <p>الرمز الرقمي المخصص لنظام المكافآت وخصومات العملاء والدفع الرقمي. مبني على شبكة ترون (TRON) بمعيار TRC-20 لضمان السرعة والشفافية.</p>

        <div class="info-box">
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">اسم الرمز:</span>
                <span class="value">TetherUSDT</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">رمز التداول (Ticker):</span>
                <span class="value">USDT</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">الشبكة المعيارية:</span>
                <span class="value">TRON (TRC-20)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">إجمالي المعروض:</span>
                <span class="value">10,000,000 KDMT</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2026 Tether USDT Ecosystem. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
